        "UART3_RX_FCC"
      ],
      "observed": "FCC1 pin 48 and pin 73, both named VCAP and typed power_out, are placed on the UART3_TX_FCC and UART3_RX_FCC signal nets.",
      "expected": "STM32H7 VCAP pins must be decoupled to ground with the required capacitors; UART3 TX/RX should connect to the MCU's UART pins and the UART3 connector, not to internal regulator outputs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"146\") (name \"UART3_TX_FCC\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"48\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\") (pintype \"power_out\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC1\") (pin \"3\") (pinfunction \"Pin_3\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"144\") (name \"UART3_RX_FCC\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"73\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\") (pintype \"power_out\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC1\") (pin \"4\") (pinfunction \"Pin_4\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The MCU internal regulator outputs are shorted to UART signal lines, preventing proper MCU operation and likely damaging or loading the UART3 interface.",
      "confidence": 0.96
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": [
        "REG2"
      ],
      "pins": [
        "REG2.1",
        "REG2.2"
      ],
      "nets": [
        "+3.3V",
        "+3V3"
      ],
      "observed": "The LDO output appears on net +3.3V, but a separate +3V3 net exists that powers MCU VBAT, SWD target power, connector power, and pull-up networks. No component or net connects +3.3V to +3V3, and +3V3 has no source.",
      "expected": "The single LD39200PU33R 3.3 V LDO should produce the board 3V3 rail that feeds the MCUs and sensors; +3.3V and +3V3 should not be separate unpowered domains.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+3.3V\") (node (ref \"REG2\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"OUT\") (pintype \"unspecified\")) (node (ref \"REG2\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"ADJ/SENSE\") (pintype \"unspecified\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"2\") (name \"+3V3\") (node (ref \"NAVC1\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"VBAT\") (pintype \"power_in\")) (node (ref \"SWD1\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"Pin_1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "An LD39200PU33R LDO, fed from the 5 V rail, produces 3V3 for \"MCUs and Sensors\""
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The +3V3 domain is floating/unpowered, so MCU backup power, SWD target power, connector power, and pull-ups on that net will not operate as intended.",
      "confidence": 0.92
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The build contains fatal connectivity deviations from the intended Hades design: both MCUs have unconnected VDD pins and NAVC ground is floating, FCC VCAP power pins are bridged into UART3 signal nets, and the 3.3 V LDO output is not connected to the separate +3V3 rail that should power MCU/SWD/connector domains."
}

